    "sm_faq_extra": "<h3>What services do you provide?</h3>\n<ul><li>DTF printing</li><li>UV DTF printing</li><li>Wholesale blanks</li><li>Wholesale/bulk printed apparel or merch</li></ul>\n<h3>Where are you located? Where is local pickup?</h3>\n<p>Our print studio is in London, ON. We offer FREE local pickup in both London, ON and St. Thomas, ON. We also offer local delivery within London.</p>\n<p>Not local? No problem! We ship fast all across Canada and the USA.</p>\n<h3>What's your turnaround time?</h3>\n<p>We print and ship fast! You can expect your order to be printed within 1-2 business days, with rush orders completed within a guaranteed 24 hour turnaround.</p>\n<p>We print Monday to Friday.</p>\n<h3>What file requirements are needed for custom transfers?</h3>\n<p><strong>.PNG files with transparent backgrounds. Your images should be high-quality at 300 dpi.</strong> Refer to our Canva Pro guide on how to save your images for higher resolution. Refer to our <a href=\"/pages/dtf-uv-instructions?view=guide\">graphics help guide</a> for more artwork help and requirements.</p>\n<h3>What happens if there's an issue with my shipment?</h3>\n<p>Please contact the courier directly (i.e. UPS) and provide them with your tracking number. They will be the best first course of action.</p>\n<p>Find our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy here</a>.</p>\n<h3>I want to discuss my recent order</h3>\n<ul><li>Please email <a href=\"mailto:info@shemakestransfers.com\">info@shemakestransfers.com</a></li><li>Provide your order number</li><li>Provide photos if applicable</li><li>Provide relevant information</li><li>Any complaints must be addressed within 48 hours of receiving your order.</li></ul>\n<p>We are very fair and will rectify any issues that are caused due to our part. We expect fairness and cooperation in return.</p>"
  },
